@startuml
!include style.iuml
top to bottom direction
hide empty members
together {
 class MenuController <<scene controller>>
 class GameController <<scene controller>>
}
package "UI: routing / view / binding" {
 class UIController <<UI routing>>
 abstract class UIPage <<view>>
 class StaticMapPanel <<view binding>>
 class UIComplete <<view binding>>
}
package "Session / model" {
 class ActiveSession <<session facade>>
 class LevelSave <<state>>
}
package "Persistence: core" {
 class SaveController <<persistence service>>
 class GlobalSave <<save container>>
 class SavedDataContainer
 interface ISaveObject <<interface>>
}
MenuController --> UIController : uiController
GameController ..> UIController : Init / ShowPage
StaticMapPanel ..> MenuController : PLAY callback
UIComplete ..> GameController : NEXT callback
UIController "1" --> "0..*" UIPage : pages / pagesLink
UIPage <|-- UIComplete
GameController ..> ActiveSession : Current.\nOnLevelCompleted()
ActiveSession --> LevelSave : levelSave
ActiveSession ..> SaveController : GetSaveObject<T>()
SaveController --> GlobalSave : globalSave
GlobalSave "1" --> "0..*" SavedDataContainer : saveObjectsList
SavedDataContainer --> ISaveObject : saveObject
LevelSave ..|> ISaveObject
note bottom of SaveController
Core Save không tham chiếu UIPage, GameController hoặc LevelSave.
T được truyền từ feature; constraint là ISaveObject.
end note
@enduml
